title: Engineering: The Dogfooded Pulse Engine
type: engineering
date: 2026-05-15
createdAt: 2026-05-15T09:00:00Z
releaseAt: 2026-05-15T15:00:00Z
author: Richard D.
stream: engineering
tags: wasm, rust, toon, rfc-2378

# The Core Achievement
body[1]{content}:
  "Today we launched the first high-performance, dogfooded blog engine for the AEC industry. By leveraging our own pkd-toon WASM parser and RFC-2378 protocol, we have eliminated the need for heavy JS-based blog plugins, moving the 'Source of Truth' directly to our high-density binary and TOON artifacts."

# Innovation Metrics
efficiency[1]{format, payload_delta, complexity}:
  TOON, -33% vs JSON, O(n) Linear Pass

# Implementation Spikes
tasks[2]{id, title, result}:
  #130, [HACKATHON] TOON Parser, 100% Rust-Native Zero-Copy Lexer
  #129, WASM-Driven Blog, Astro 6 Custom Loader Integration
